WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.069
"It's a beautiful day," said Dad.

2
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.783
"Let's have a picnic in the park."

3
00:00:15.784 --> 00:00:20.460
"I don't like picnics," said Oliver.

4
00:00:20.461 --> 00:00:24.021
"We can play Frisbee," said Emmy.

5
00:00:24.022 --> 00:00:28.870
"We can look for frogs," said Harry.

6
00:00:28.871 --> 00:00:35.257
"We can eat lunch in the warm sun," said Mom.

7
00:00:35.258 --> 00:00:39.239
"Fine," Oliver said.

8
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.460
"But it won't be fun."

9
00:00:43.461 --> 00:00:49.213
"Let's get ready," said Dad.

10
00:00:49.214 --> 00:01:00.827
Mom put food in the picnic basket.

11
00:01:00.828 --> 00:01:05.038
Emmy and Harry found the Frisbee.

12
00:01:05.039 --> 00:01:18.708
Then everyone drove to the park.

13
00:01:18.709 --> 00:01:22.645
"Let's look for frogs," said Harry.

14
00:01:22.646 --> 00:01:35.102
"First let's play Frisbee!" said Emmy.

15
00:01:35.103 --> 00:01:38.549
Emmy threw the Frisbee to Harry.

16
00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:42.737
Harry threw the Frisbee to Oliver.

17
00:01:42.738 --> 00:01:47.692
Oliver threw the Frisbee to Dad.

18
00:01:47.693 --> 00:01:50.163
The Frisbee went over Dad's head.

19
00:01:50.164 --> 00:01:54.858
Splash! The Frisbee went in the frog pond!

20
00:01:54.859 --> 00:02:00.393
"Oh no," said Harry.

21
00:02:00.394 --> 00:02:06.236
"We scared away all the frogs!"

22
00:02:06.237 --> 00:02:14.536
"Time for lunch," said Dad.

23
00:02:14.537 --> 00:02:19.423
Dad handed out the sandwiches.

24
00:02:19.424 --> 00:02:24.459
"Mmm," said Mom. "I love—"

25
00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:31.203
Boom!

26
00:02:31.204 --> 00:02:34.044
"What was that?" asked Oliver.

27
00:02:34.045 --> 00:02:38.834
"I think it's thunder," said Emmy.

28
00:02:38.835 --> 00:02:43.165
"It's starting to rain!" said Harry.

29
00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:46.971
Mom packed up all the food.

30
00:02:46.972 --> 00:02:51.290
The family ran back to the car.

31
00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:57.158
Dad handed out the food again.

32
00:02:57.159 --> 00:03:00.968
Oliver watched the rain.

33
00:03:00.969 --> 00:03:06.388
He ate his sandwich.

34
00:03:06.389 --> 00:03:18.416
"What a fun picnic!" he said.

